    localArea:
      "Within Junagadh, Junagadh Town has its own rhythm on a wedding evening, and we adjust truck routing and timing to match it rather than using one fixed plan across the whole city.\n\nBeyond Junagadh Town, we're just as active in MG Road, Zanzarda Road, and Moti Baug across Junagadh — most Junagadh venues aren't more than a short drive apart, so overlapping guest lists and vendor timing rarely cause issues. Just flag your venue when you reach out.",
    whatsIncluded:
      "Every package for a Junagadh Town baraat starts with the same base: the DJ truck, sound system, and DJ artist. Raj Tilak, our entry package, adds 2 dhol players and chhatri lights — a solid choice for a smaller or more budget-conscious Junagadh wedding. Rajwada builds on that with 2 more dhol (4 total) and a teddy or gorilla performer for extra energy on the street. Maharaja, our most popular package, adds moving LED panels and the groom's name lit up in lights, with 6 dhol players keeping the beat.\n\nSignature, our top package, is built for Junagadh Town families who want the full experience — it adds a security team plus pyro and confetti effects timed to the truck's arrival, along with an upgraded American vintage car. Importantly, the vintage car and the My Safa turban team are included from Raj Tilak upward in every package, so even the smallest booking for your Junagadh wedding comes with a proper car and full turban styling for the groom's entire group, not just the groom.",
